@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Cloudflare Agents runtime
+
+The registered agents are inspected `Think` subclasses. `SupportAgent.getTools()` includes a known status tool and an open runtime-selected spread, so its final tool registry remains unresolved. `StepSupportAgent.configureSession()` delegates to helper-built session configuration; that construction does not establish a direct instruction-loader binding. `delegate_support` is an ordinary function tool whose implementation references `StepSupportAgent`, not a handoff or routing target. `RuntimeInitializedAgent` is outside the selected closed class target because it has an executable initialized field.
+
+The deploying application owns the Cloudflare Durable Object bindings for selected agent classes, a migration that adds their SQLite-backed classes, and deployment configuration and ordering. Keep binding class names, migration entries, and exported Worker classes aligned; canonical runtime relationships do not create or apply them.
